[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18124.05, "timestamp": "05:02:04", "text": "。好了，是時候學習這個技巧了，兄弟。我就掛在那兒。過來，過來看看。我的天哪。我的天哪。醒醒。是啊。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 18127.111, "timestamp": "05:02:07", "author": "@Minkk102", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/TF8h5uIigJBanBg4LA_XZaY69S8H6wHtAUIDSGgMxHUqkEYRKq0z9m5NM8cqeDFnXLN0nN8i8g=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "classic astra ahh moment"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18128.55, "timestamp": "05:02:08", "text": "好了。他們能像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18133.51, "timestamp": "05:02:13", "text": "我想我找到上去的辦法了。我就在手錶上蹭來蹭去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18135.07, "timestamp": "05:02:15", "text": "霍爾·"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18138.23, "timestamp": "05:02:18", "text": "莫斯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18140.55, "timestamp": "05:02:20", "text": "哦，就這麼簡單。好了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18146.47, "timestamp": "05:02:26", "text": "。等等，什麼？按住滑鼠的兩個按鈕，然後把它拉下來。把它拉下來。是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18177.99, "timestamp": "05:02:57", "text": "抬頭看。按住滑鼠的兩個按鈕向下拖動，把自己拉上去"}]